{"reviewId": "495390_83IJ45OCf", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "它揭示了周期的本质是“技术进化”，而非简单的经济起伏。一个康波的“生命”，是从一项技术的萌芽到它衰老死亡的全过程。\n\n它解释了为何在“衰退期”人们反而感觉最好：因为那是泡沫最绚烂的时刻，是旧周期回光返照的“黄金时代”，但也是危机的前夜。\n\n它指导了真正的投资时机：最大的机会不在众人狂欢的“衰退期”，而是在绝望中播种的“回升期”。而最大的风险，则隐藏在看似美好的“衰退期”末尾。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "range": "2025-2121", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "495390_83IJ45OCf", "userVid": 495390, "topics": [], "createTime": 1759826185, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 495390, "name": "beben", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-vKIRqiUsPjlaVFQ3ixXnMcb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "阅读/输出/运动", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "平芜尽处是春山", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-200", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 200}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 152, "likes": [{"userVid": 243054027, "name": "星星", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/rGJ4gEicoWy2iclR1cdGvyIeObVMoCO2FImP1Kb1CIOicheiaoyvbyekblQiczSw4ruUktlmiaFvqicFmRriaxgeT6wT8pLTnWLLJVSaTy3oOJEk2fQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "星星", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 5, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"conte